OL,3,GNEWSAFlights diverted after drones
OL,4,Aflown near airport
OL,5,
OL,6,FFlights were diverted and cancelled due
OL,7,Fto "unauthorised drone activity" near
OL,8,Fan airport.
OL,10,FJersey Airport said three flights were
OL,11,Fdiverted back to the UK because of
OL,12,Fdrones flying in the airport's
OL,13,Frestricted airspace on Friday evening.
OL,15,FStates of Jersey Police said it
OL,16,Fresponded to the incident with the
OL,17,FHonorary Police, Channel Islands Air
OL,18,FSearch, Government of Jersey colleagues
OL,19,Fand Ports of Jersey staff.
OL,23,APub: 31-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
